  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=256, C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 1: Interpolate to n=512 + subgradient ---\n  Interpolated C5=0.3813816713\n  After subgrad C5=0.3810018554\n\n--- Phase 2: L-BFGS-B smooth max ---\n  beta=50: C5=0.3872949898\n  beta=200: C5=0.3832411253\n  beta=800: C5=0.3822098368\n  beta=3000: C5=0.3819799124\n\n--- Phase 3: Adaptive subgradient ---\n  C5=0.3818342057\n\n--- Phase 4: L-BFGS-B round 2 ---\n  beta=500: C5=0.3818600249\n  beta=2000: C5=0.3821031461\n  beta=8000: C5=0.3817513153\n\n--- Phase 5: Perturbation exploration ---\n\n--- Phase 6: Simulated annealing ---\n  SA C5=0.3817513153\n\n--- Phase 7: Try n=384 ---\n  n=384: C5=0.3810328181\n\n--- Phase 8: Try n=1024 ---\n  n=1024: C5=0.3811731527\n\n--- Phase 9: Coordinate descent ---\n  CD C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 10: Final L-BFGS-B ---\n  beta=3000: C5=0.3810658224\n  beta=10000: C5=0.3809616145\n\nFINAL: n=256, C5=0.3809571535",
